[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0309","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-12271","title":"Sophos XG Firewall login.jsp SQL注入漏洞","description":"Sophos XG Firewall 设备的 login.jsp 页面存在 SQL 注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向暴露在 WAN 区域的 HTTPS 管理服务或用户门户发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞。成功利用可导致远程代码执行，进而窃取本地设备管理员、门户管理员及远程访问用户的用户名和哈希密码（但不影响外部 Active Directory 或 LDAP 密码）。该漏洞影响 SFOS 17.0、17.1、17.5 及 18.0 版本（2020-04-25 之前），CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，且已在 2020 年 4 月被野外利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-12271"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-27T04:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:51:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sophos XG Firewall 固件至以下修复版本：SFOS 17.0 升级至 17.0 GA Hotfix、SFOS 17.1 升级至 17.1 GA Hotfix、SFOS 17.5 升级至 17.5 GA Hotfix、SFOS 18.0 升级至 18.0 MR3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，应确保管理后台 (HTTPS) 和用户门户 (User Portal) 不暴露在 WAN 区域，仅允许内网管理地址访问，并在防火墙 WAN 侧配置 IPS/IDS 规则拦截针对 /login.jsp 的 SQL 注入攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.sophos.com/kb/en-us/135412","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html","https://news.sophos.com/en-us/2020/04/26/asnarok/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-12271","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-12271.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-12271-4473.yaml","https://github.com/Twigonometry/Cybersecurity-Notes/blob/6034c0860f93ad603f5b6d6ad5f46885a6a48ebe/Vulnerabilities/Networking/CVE-2020-12271.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-12271.md","https://github.com/jaeles-project/jaeles-signatures/blob/98b358e9737131b01d5ab0685c063be52e3e3754/cves/sophos-xg-sqli-cve-2020-12271.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-12271.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-12271.json","https://github.com/CharanRayudu/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/6418cf9ac43a7d4121d979ae9afb12f54511729e/CVE-2020-12271.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2020/CVE-2020-12271.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-12271.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0309.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1708","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-6820","title":"Mozilla Firefox ReadableStream 释放后重利用漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 浏览器缓存子系统存在释放后重用（use-after-free）漏洞，具体位于 `CacheStreamControlParent` 组件的 IPDL 接口实现中。当浏览器收到关闭或中止命令时，若仍有读取流处于打开状态，会触发 `StreamList::CloseAll` 函数，导致 `CacheStreamControlParent` 对象被提前释放，随后访问其 `mId` 成员时发生释放后重用。该漏洞存在于 Firefox 74.0.1 之前版本、Firefox ESR 68.6.1 之前版本及 Thunderbird 68.7.0 之前版本，攻击条件为利用竞争条件在缓存查询过程中触发关闭操作，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，结合 CVE-2020-6819 可实现从渲染器沙箱逃逸至浏览器主进程，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞已被发现存在针对性在野攻击利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2020-6820"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-24T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:23:51Z","remediation":"将 Firefox 升级至 74.0.1 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 68.6.1 或更高版本，Thunderbird 升级至 68.7.0 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级，可在 Firefox 设置中禁用 JavaScript (about:config → javascript.enabled 设为 false) 作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1626728","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4335-1/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-11/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-14/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-6820","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-6820.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-6820.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/6xxx/CVE-2020-6820.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-6820.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-6820.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-6820.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2020-6820","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-6820.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2020-6820","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2020-6820"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0020","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-6819","title":"Mozilla Firefox 及 Thunderbird 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 和 Thunderbird 的 nsDocShell 析构函数中存在竞争条件漏洞。当 nsDocShell 对象被销毁时，存在一个竞态窗口，攻击者可以利用该窗口触发释放后重用（use-after-free），从而可能导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 低于 74.0.1 的版本、Firefox ESR 低于 68.6.1 的版本以及 Thunderbird 低于 68.7.0 的版本。攻击者可通过构造特制的网页内容或邮件，诱导用户浏览恶意页面或打开恶意邮件以触发该漏洞。由于该漏洞已存在已知的在野定向攻击案例，用户应尽快升级到安全版本以防范潜在威胁。该漏洞由竞争条件（CWE-362）和使用后释放（CWE-416）共同导致，CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.1（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2020-6819"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-24T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:23:51Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 74.0.1 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 68.6.1 或更高版本，Thunderbird 升级至 68.7.0 或更高版本。如无法立即更新，可在 Firefox 偏好设置中禁用 JavaScript 或安装 NoScript 扩展以限制脚本执行作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不受信任的网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1620818","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4335-1/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-11/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-14/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-6819","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-6819.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/6xxx/CVE-2020-6819.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-6819.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-6819.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2020-6819","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-6819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2020/UBUNTU-CVE-2020-6819.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-6819.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2020-6819","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2020-6819"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1314","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3161","title":"Cisco IP Phones Web 服务器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IP Phones 内置 Web 服务器存在输入验证不足漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码或导致受影响 IP 电话重新加载，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞由 Web 服务器对 HTTP 请求缺乏适当的输入验证导致，攻击者无需任何身份凭据即可远程利用。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制受影响设备或造成通信服务中断，CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.8，危害等级严重。Cisco 已在后续固件更新中修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快升级至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3161"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T20:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:17:31Z","remediation":"升级到修复版本：桌面话机升级至 11.7(1) 固件，8831 会议话机升级至 10.3(1)SR6，8821/8821-EX 无线话机升级至 11.0(5)SR3。如短期内无法升级，在 Cisco Unified Communications Manager 中关闭受影响话机的 Web Access（Device > Phone > 选择话机 > 将 Web Access 设为 Disabled）作为临时缓解措施，因为 Web 访问默认即已禁用，关闭后话机不再受此漏洞影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157265/Cisco-IP-Phone-11.7-Denial-Of-Service.html","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-voip-phones-rce-dos-rB6EeRXs","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3161","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48342","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3161.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3161.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3161.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3161.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-3161/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-3161.md","https://github.com/tenable/poc/blob/2e059363445565bee52566cf34ebc7f5982e5610/cisco/ip_phone/cve_2020_3161.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-3161.md","https://github.com/developer3000S/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/5362feecf9e48e17ecc9407c5f6eea87373ae3ee/2020/CVE-2020-3161.json","https://github.com/hectorgie/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/0d5cf3363234ca8d5edd59464dd228a81da02352/2020/CVE-2020-3161.json","https://github.com/abood05972/CVE-2020-3161"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0111","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1027","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核在处理内存对象时存在权限提升漏洞（CWE-787 越界写入），由于内核未能正确验证对象操作的内存边界，导致低权限攻击者可在本地系统上通过执行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 SYSTEM 权限并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 7 至 Windows 10 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2019。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无法远程利用。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1027"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T15:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:00:15Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 4 月安全更新。Windows 10 1909/1903 用户安装 KB4549951，Windows 7/8.1/Server 等版本安装对应月度安全更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过配置 AppLocker 或 Windows Defender Application Control 限制 CSRSS 对不受信任的 SxS 清单的访问，并启用 Credential Guard 缓解提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/168068/Windows-sxs-CNodeFactory-XMLParser_Element_doc_assembly_assemblyIdentity-Heap-Buffer-Overflow.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1027","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1027","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1027.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-1027.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2020/1xxx/CVE-2020-1027.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-1027.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-1027.json","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-1027.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-1027.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-1027.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-1027.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0108","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1020","title":"Microsoft Windows Adobe Font Manager 库远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 的 Adobe Type Manager 库在处理特制的多主字体（Adobe Type 1 PostScript 格式）时存在内存越界写入漏洞。攻击者可诱使用户打开特制字体文件或预览包含恶意字体的文档，在除 Windows 10 之外的所有系统上实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8/8.1/Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1020"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T15:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:00:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 4 月安全更新（对应 KB4549951/ KB4550944/ KB4550922 等，视系统版本而定），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。对于无法立即打补丁的 Windows 7/Server 2008 系统，可通过注册表禁用 ATMFD.DLL：将 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\KnownDLLs` 下新增 `ATMFD` 项值为 `0`，或重命名 `%windir%\\system32\\atmfvd.dll` 为 `atmfvd.dll.old` 以阻止加载，注意此操作可能影响 Adobe Type 1 字体渲染功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-1020","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-1020","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-15020.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10209.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10204.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10207.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10203.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10208.md","https://github.com/magicming200/CVE-2020-10199_CVE-2020-10204","https://github.com/wsfengfan/CVE-2020-10199-10204","https://github.com/zhzyker/CVE-2020-10204","https://github.com/KaLendsi/CVE-2020-1020","https://github.com/CrackerCat/CVE-2020-1020-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0066","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0968","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 脚本引擎内存损坏漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 脚本引擎在处理内存中对象时存在内存损坏漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制网站诱导用户访问，触发该漏洞导致远程代码执行。攻击者成功利用后可获取与当前用户相同的权限，安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 11 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0968"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T15:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:06Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 4 月安全更新（Internet Explorer 累积更新 KB4550951 及对应 Windows 版本的补丁），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），建议优先修复。如无法立即打补丁，可配置组策略禁用 Internet Explorer 中的 JScript 脚本引擎，或使用 Microsoft 提供的缓解工具（EMET/Windows Defender Exploit Guard）启用内存保护机制作为临时措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0968","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0968","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0968.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0968.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-0968.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-0968.json","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/xdspy/README.adoc","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-0968.json","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/345 - AppSec Ezine","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-0968.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-0968.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0055","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0938","title":"Microsoft Windows Adobe Font Manager 库远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 的 Adobe Type Manager 库在处理特制的多主字体（Adobe Type 1 PostScript 格式）时存在内存越界写入漏洞。攻击者可构造恶意字体文件，通过诱导用户打开特制文档或在预览窗格中查看等方式触发漏洞，在受影响系统上实现远程代码执行。该漏洞已被检测到在野利用，影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本（Windows 10 除外需用户交互，Windows 10 上利用难度更高）。Microsoft 已于 2020 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0938"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T15:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:01Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 4 月安全更新：Windows 10 v2004 安装 KB4557957，v1909 安装 KB4549951，v1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4549949，v1803 安装 KB4550922，Windows 7/Server 2008 安装 KB4550964。如无法打补丁，可禁用 WebClient 服务（sc config WebClient start= disabled）并重命名 ATMFD.DLL 为 ATMFD.DLL.bak 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161299/Apple-CoreText-libFontParser.dylib-Stack-Corruption.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0938","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0938","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-0938.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-1020.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-0938.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1206","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-2883","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server T3 协议远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 Core 组件存在 Java 反序列化漏洞，该漏洞是对 CVE-2020-2555 安全补丁的绕过。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 T3 或 IIOP 协议向目标服务器发送特制的序列化数据，利用 ReflectionExtractor 或 MvelExtractor/UniversalExtractor 构造新的 Gadget Chain 绕过反序列化黑名单，最终在服务器上执行任意代码并完全接管 WebLogic Server。该漏洞影响 Oracle WebLogic Server 10.3.6、12.1.3、12.2.1.3 和 12.2.1.4 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，只要攻击者能够通过网络访问目标服务器的 T3 或 IIOP 端口即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-2883"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-15T14:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:13:10Z","remediation":"立即升级到最新版本的Oracle Weblogic Server（12.2.1.4.0或更高版本），并应用最新的安全补丁。通过Weblogic控制台禁用不必要的T3协议服务，或配置防火墙仅允许受信任IP地址访问Weblogic端口。如无法立即升级，建议将Weblogic服务移出互联网直接部署于内部网络，并开启详细访问日志以监控异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157950/WebLogic-Server-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2020.html","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-504/","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-570/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-2883","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2020/CVE-2020-2883.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2883.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2020-2883_cmd.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-2883.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2020/2xxx/CVE-2020-2883.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-2883.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-2883/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Weblogic/（CVE-2020-2883）Weblogic 远程代码执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2546.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-2883.md","https://github.com/hktalent/MyDocs/blob/d929b97bd9e74f77e0720cb9116c33ba2b84684c/CVE-2020-2883.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub","https://github.com/zhzyker/vulmap","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/Y4er/WebLogic-Shiro-shell","https://github.com/Y4er/CVE-2020-2883"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0300","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-11738","title":"WordPress Duplicator 插件路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress Snap Creek Duplicator 插件（及 Duplicator Pro）存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 `duplicator_download` 或 `duplicator_init` 接口的 `file` 参数传递 `../` 路径序列，实现任意文件读取，获取服务器敏感信息如 wp-config.php 等配置文件。该漏洞影响 Duplicator 版本低于 1.3.28 及 Duplicator Pro 版本低于 3.8.7.1，无需登录即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-11738"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-13T22:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:50:42Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress Duplicator 免费版升级至 1.3.28 或更高版本，Duplicator Pro 升级至 3.8.7.1 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加规则，拦截对 duplicator_download 和 duplicator_init 接口中包含 ../ 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160621/WordPress-Duplicator-1.3.26-Directory-Traversal-File-Read.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/164533/WordPress-Duplicator-1.3.26-Arbitrary-File-Read.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/23.html","https://snapcreek.com/duplicator/docs/changelog/?lite","https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2020/02/active-attack-on-recently-patched-duplicator-plugin-vulnerability-affects-over-1-million-sites/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-11738","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50420","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-11738.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-11738.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2020/CVE-2020-11738.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2020-11738.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/web/wordpress/CVE-2020-11738.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/CMS漏洞/WordPress Duplicator duplicator.php 任意文件读取漏洞 CVE-2020-11738.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2020/11xxx/CVE-2020-11738.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2020/CVE-2020-11738.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-11738.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-11738.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-11738/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/raghu66669999/wordpress-snapcreek"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1520","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3952","title":"VMware vCenter Server 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"CVE-2020-3952是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3952"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-10T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:19:19Z","remediation":"将受影响的 VMware vCenter Server 6.7（嵌入式或外部 Platform Services Controller）升级至 6.7 Update 3f (6.7u3f) 版本。升级前请参阅 VMware KB78543 确认当前部署是否从旧版本（6.0 或 6.5）升级而来，全新安装的 6.7 不受此漏洞影响。vCenter Server 7.0 不受影响，无需操作。升级完成后重启 vmdir 服务以确保补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157896/VMware-vCenter-Server-6.7-Authentication-Bypass.html","https://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2020-0006","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3952","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48535","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-3952.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3952.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2020/CVE-2020-3952.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2020-3952.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-3952-5127.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3952.json","https://github.com/tijldeneut/Security/blob/24b4cbd974d39d7c4ff1ae31bed41b3522106994/CVE-2020-3952.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3952.md","https://github.com/bhdresh/SnortRules/blob/36aed344abdc19ad2edbbf933a0d368c0bda5d19/Exploit/CVE-2020-3952.rules","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3952.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-3952/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/guardicore/vmware_vcenter_cve_2020_3952","https://github.com/Fa1c0n35/vmware_vcenter_cve_2020_3952","https://github.com/chronoloper/CVE-2020-3952","https://github.com/gelim/CVE-2020-3952","https://github.com/Fa1c0n35/https-github.com-guardicore-vmware_vcenter_cve_2020_3952"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1683","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5735","title":"Amcrest 摄像头及NVR 堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Amcrest 网络摄像头及 NVR 设备在 TCP 37777 端口存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。经过身份验证的远程攻击者可向该端口发送特制数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致设备拒绝服务或执行任意代码。影响 Amcrest 及兼容 Dahua 协议的 NVR 设备。攻击者需先获得有效凭据才能利用此漏洞，利用后可能完全控制设备并进一步渗透内网。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5735"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-08T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:08Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备固件升级至安全版本：IP2M-841升级至v2.420.AC00.18.R.20200217或更高版本，IP2M-841B/IP2M-853EW/IP2M-858W/IP2M-866EW/IP2M-866W/IP4M-1053EW/1080-Lite 8CH升级至v2.623.00AC004.0.R.200316或更高版本，IP8M-2454EW/IP8M-2493EB/IP8M-2496EB/IP8M-MB2546EW/IP8M-MT2544EW/IP8M-T2499EW升级至v2.622.00AC000.0.R.200320或更高版本，IP8M-2597E升级至v2.800.00AC000.0.R.200330或更高版本，IPM-721/IPM-HX1/AMDV10814-H5升级至v2.420.AC00.18.R.20200217或更高版本。如无法立即升级，应在边界防火墙或路由器上限制TCP 37777端口的访问，仅允许可信管理网段IP地址访问该端口，以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157164/Amcrest-Dahua-NVR-Camera-IP2M-841-Denial-Of-Service.html","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2020-20","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5735","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48304","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5735.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5735.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-5735.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-5735.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-5735.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-5735.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2020/CVE-2020-5735/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2020/CVE-2020-5735/README_KO.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-5735.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2020/CVE-2020-5735.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0106","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-10199","title":"Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager Java表达式注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager 3.21.2 之前版本存在 Java EL 注入漏洞（CWE-917）。具有低权限的远程攻击者可通过向受影响组件的特定接口发送特制的 HTTP 请求，注入恶意的 Java 表达式语言（EL）脚本，从而在服务器端执行任意代码。该漏洞可导致目标系统被完全控制，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，已有公开的 Metasploit 利用模块及多种 PoC 脚本广泛流传。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-10199"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-04-01T19:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager 升级至 3.21.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 nexus.properties 中添加 `nexus.scripts.allowCreation=false` 配置项禁用脚本创建功能作为临时缓解措施，同时限制对 Nexus 管理后台的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段访问 8081 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157261/Nexus-Repository-Manager-3.21.1-01-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160835/Sonatype-Nexus-3.21.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/917.html","https://support.sonatype.com/hc/en-us/articles/360044882533","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-10199","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48343","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-10199.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/nexus/cve-2020-10199_poc.py","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2020/CVE-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/nexus/cve-2020-10199_cmd.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/nexus/CVE-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/threedr3am/learnjavabug/blob/3f7fe9d8eab29f88fd0c6fb8362d21696b5cb95c/nexus/CVE-2020-10199/README.md","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/01-CMS漏洞/Nexus/cve-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/漏洞技术_-_CVE-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-10199.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10204.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub","https://github.com/zhzyker/CVE-2020-10199_POC-EXP","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2020-10199","https://github.com/aleenzz/CVE-2020-10199","https://github.com/magicming200/CVE-2020-10199_CVE-2020-10204"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0106.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1682","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5722","title":"Grandstream UCM6200 系列未授权远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Grandstream UCM6200 系列统一通信管理平台的 HTTP 接口存在未授权远程 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求在无需身份认证的情况下向目标系统注入恶意 SQL 语句，进而在版本低于 1.0.19.20 的设备上以 root 权限执行任意系统命令，或在版本低于 1.0.20.17 的设备上向密码恢复邮件中注入恶意 HTML 内容。该漏洞影响 UCM6200、UCM6202 等多款型号，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何凭据即可远程利用，且 ExploitDB 及 Metasploit 均已公开可用利用代码，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5722"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-23T20:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:06Z","remediation":"标签之间。<value>立即将 Grandstream UCM6200 系列设备固件升级至 1.0.20.17 或更高版本，以修复未授权远程 SQL 注入漏洞。若暂无法立即升级，应在边界防火墙或 WAF 中限制对设备 HTTP 管理接口的外部访问，仅允许受信任的 IP 段访问，并关闭无需的远程管理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156876/UCM6202-1.0.18.13-Remote-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/165708/Grandstream-UCM62xx-IP-PBX-sendPasswordEmail-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2020-15","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5722","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48247","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5722.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5722.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5722.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5722.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/76a9c1d3e08b5513880c6f072ae2e14cd09953e6/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5722.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-5722.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-5722.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-5722.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/929b6ea1a1a05b6cd00f9afcd22053f36ec0c5dc/modules/exploits/linux/http/grandstream_ucm62xx_sendemail_rce.rb","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-5722.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5722.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1800","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-7961","title":"Liferay Portal JSONWS 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Liferay Portal 7.2.1 CE GA2 及之前版本的 JSON Web Services（JSONWS）接口存在不可信数据反序列化漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 JSONWS 请求，利用 Java 对象反序列化机制触发远程代码执行，从而完全绕过身份验证并在服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本部署的 Liferay Portal 系统，攻击者无需凭据即可在目标服务器上获得与应用程序相同权限的代码执行能力，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-7961"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-20T19:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:25:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Liferay Portal CE 升级至 7.2.1 GA2 或更高版本（Liferay DXP 7.2 需应用 fix pack 5 或更高补丁包），以修复 JSONWS 接口中的 Java 反序列化漏洞。如暂时无法升级，应在反向代理或防火墙层拦截对 /api/jsonws/ 及 /api/jsonws/ajax 等路径的未授权外部访问，仅允许可信内网 IP 调用 JSONWS 接口，同时监控访问日志中是否存在包含恶意序列化载荷的 POST 请求。此外建议在 WAF 中部署规则，拦截 JSONWS 请求体中包含 java.lang.Runtime 或 ProcessBuilder 关键字的外部调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157254/Liferay-Portal-Java-Unmarshalling-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158392/Liferay-Portal-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://portal.liferay.dev/learn/security/known-vulnerabilities","https://portal.liferay.dev/learn/security/known-vulnerabilities/-/asset_publisher/HbL5mxmVrnXW/content/id/117954271","https://research.checkpoint.com/2021/freakout-leveraging-newest-vulnerabilities-for-creating-a-botnet/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-7961","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48332","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-7961.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2020/CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/CMS漏洞/Liferay Portal CE 反序列化命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/liferay-portal/CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/cms/Liferay-Portal-CE-反序列化命令执行漏洞-CVE-2020-7961.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/(CVE-2020-7961)Liferay_Portal_RCE_反序列化命令执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-7961/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-7961.py","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/Windows10Exploits/blob/9790226d07e5285143c3531bc9797a609a83162b/Undefined/CVE-2020-7961/README.MD","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/Windows10Exploits/blob/9790226d07e5285143c3531bc9797a609a83162b/Undefined/CVE-2020-7961/ref","https://github.com/mzer0one/CVE-2020-7961-POC","https://github.com/random-robbie/liferay-pwn","https://github.com/ShutdownRepo/CVE-2020-7961","https://github.com/thelostworldFree/CVE-2020-7961-payloads","https://github.com/dinosn/liferay-ga4-rce-research"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1800.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1800.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1800.toml"}]